//　上だ！
//　あの砲の死角である上へ――
  Up! The only way that cannon can't track us!

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/mc03/023vs0590a01'>
//《躱し……たっ！》
《We made it...!》

//　紙一重。
//　現世と黄泉の境界線を、<RUBY text='・・・・'>こちら側</RUBY>へ転がり込む。
  It was close, but once again, we have clawed our way back from the precipice.

//　危なかった。
//　だが、これで敵の手は尽き、
  And now, at last, our enemy has exhausted all of their―

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mc03/023vs0600a00'>
//「な」
"!"
